    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102455" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰρῑχ-ηΐη</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>preserving, pickling</i>,
			in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ταριχείας φαῦλοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					607b28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mete.</u>
				359a16
			</span></i>: sg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γογγυλίδας εἰς τ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				736.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.745
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mummification,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PEleph.
				8.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				40.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>maceration</i>, Olymp.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.69B.
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταριχεῖαι</span> prob. <i>factories for
				salting fish</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.15
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				113
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.1.8
			</span></i>.</div>
